<title>GREECE: GREEK NATL MORTGAGE BANK JOINS DIAS PAYMENTS SYSTEM.</title>
<headline>GREEK NATL MORTGAGE BANK JOINS DIAS PAYMENTS SYSTEM.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The ATM network of the state National Mortgage Bank of Greece was linked to the DIAS payments system, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The state National Bank of Greece, state Ionian Bank, private Dorian Bank and Citibank have their ATMs already hooked up to Dias linking 750 ATMs in 253 city points throughout Greece. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
